5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope we are all feeling well today.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Morning, Shizue! I’m really excited to see what we can improve for everyone this year.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,Morning. I hope we can find a plan that doesn’t just add more work for the same tired people.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I appreciate the optimism, Yumi. Let’s ensure we actually review the data before we commit to anything.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree with Mizuki. Optimism is lovely, but data is safer. Let’s see what the numbers actually say before we cheer.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the calendar slipping again. Let’s look at the weather days in the site diaries and the survey findings in the older blocks.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I’m worried about how long projects take and how rooms are used later. I’ll check the timetable records and booking data.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I’ll examine the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I want to know which projects actually worked. I’ll check the post-occupancy review ratings and the decade of delivery schedules.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll examine the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I hope the diaries show us where the rain truly bites. Let’s see if we can plan around the weather, not just suffer through it.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I hope the booking data shows us if people actually use the spaces we build. Let’s make sure we aren’t just creating empty rooms!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I suspect the freeze has left us stretched thin. I want to see if the technicians are drowning in manual tasks.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I suspect the delivery schedules will reveal a pattern of slippage. Let’s see if comfort projects consistently underperform.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect the paper figures are fiction. Let’s see if the market has finally caught up with our delusions.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I am looking forward to seeing what the diaries and surveys reveal. Let us hope for a clearer path ahead.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I’m counting on the booking data to tell the truth about how we actually use these spaces. See you all next round!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I’ll see if the logs confirm my fears about the workload. Let’s hope the data is honest.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I’ll see if the reviews confirm my suspicion that we rarely ask what actually worked. Let’s hope the data is honest.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect the reserve is empty. Let’s see if we’re paying for ghosts. See you next round.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
