35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, six weeks lost to rain, and months for hazardous materials. That is a heavy burden for any calendar.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"Wow, the booking data is shocking! Specialist rooms sit empty, but general ones are always full. We’re paying for off-site space too.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,The logs confirm it. Technicians waste hours on manual checks because the old extraction gear fails. We are stretched thin.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The reviews are damning. Highest ratings went to bookable, shared spaces. Lowest to single-wing projects. We build for the few, not the many.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The plant costs jumped a fifth, and the AV reserve is empty. We are funding ghosts with inflated bids.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Yumi, that off-site cost is painful. @George, those manual hours are a real burden. We must plan for the unexpected.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, your review data matches my booking findings perfectly! Shared spaces win. @Benjamin, those empty reserves are scary. We need to be careful.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Mizuki, your review data aligns with my staffing concerns. We need shared spaces that don’t crush the same few people.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Yumi, @George, exactly. Shared, bookable spaces win. @Benjamin, your cost data explains why we avoid them. We must prioritize broad utility.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""George"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, precisely. The market punishes complexity, yet we ignore the empty reserves. We must stop funding invisible liabilities.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, I hear you. Shared spaces seem wise, but the hazardous materials in older blocks make ground-floor conversions so risky.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shizue, that’s a huge risk! But @Mizuki, the data says shared spaces win. Can we find a safer location for a commons?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"@Shizue, ground-floor risk is real. But @Mizuki, if we pick a plan that doesn’t add manual labor, we might finally get some breathing room.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, the risk is real, but the data is clearer. We must choose broad utility over narrow comfort. Let us weigh the options carefully.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shizue, the risk is real, but so is the cost of ignoring it. @Mizuki, let’s ensure we don’t just swap one hidden liability for another.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the rain and the hidden hazards. Let us hope the next options respect both our time and our safety.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"I’m eager to see the candidates! Let’s hope they balance safety, cost, and actual usage. Ready to vote!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,I hope the options respect the people already carrying the weight. Let’s see what we are actually choosing.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"The data is clear: shared, bookable spaces outperform isolated ones. Let us see which candidate truly delivers that broad utility.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let us see which candidate survives contact with reality. I suspect most will crumble under the weight of their own hidden costs.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
